# r1107tp boot a5: same save; tempad-common.toml defaults + allow_interdimensional_travel = false; scratch tag
# kubejs/data/tempad/tags/dimension_type/intradimensional_travel_not_supported.json (minecraft:overworld) written
# before the boot. Reruns of SQ-TP-22b / -22c (a4 BATCH-FAULT: the toml is not reloaded while running).
pace 1

## SQ-TP-22b2 | allow_interdimensional_travel = false (restart)
bootexpect Done \(
shell grep -E "^allow_" config/tempad-common.toml; cat kubejs/data/tempad/tags/dimension_type/*.json
> pbot spawn qa 0.5 -60 0.5 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 3
> clear qa
> item replace entity qa hotbar.0 with tempad:tempad
> ztp setchr qa 0 6000
> ztp open qa tempad:default Hell Spot
waitlog \[ztp\] open 20
expect \[ztp\] open .*"Hell Spot".* -> message ".*" key entity\.tempad\.timedoor\.fail\.interdimensional chronons 6000 -> 6000

## SQ-TP-22c2 | intradimensional_travel_not_supported tag (overworld), allow_intradimensional_travel = true
> ztp open qa tempad:default Far East
waitlog \[ztp\] open .*Far 20
expect \[ztp\] open .*"Far East".* -> message ".*" key entity\.tempad\.timedoor\.fail\.intradimensional chronons 6000 -> 6000
> ztp doors
waitlog \[ztp\] doors total 20
expect \[ztp\] doors total 0
